            <pubDate>Mon, 10 Aug 2026 14:05:12 -0400</pubDate>
            <link>https://hibiscus.page</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/RUGUX/hibiscus-releases/releases</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>13</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.8.5</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[## Data-safety hotfix

- Moves Hibiscus's default notes database into an app-specific folder so other unsandboxed macOS apps cannot open or migrate it.
- Safely copies and verifies existing databases during the upgrade while preserving the original files.
- Stops in recovery instead of showing an empty database or inserting welcome notes if a migrated store is unexpectedly empty.
]]></description>
